00:33:38.930 --> 00:33:43.610
So, as a brief conclusion,
today, I examined the cultural

00:33:43.610 --> 00:33:47.570
production of the anime girl
avatar in VRChat to understand

00:33:47.570 --> 00:33:50.810
sociotechnical relations towards
virtual world making. I

00:33:50.810 --> 00:33:54.440
deconstructed cultural biases
and social VR explored the

00:33:54.440 --> 00:33:58.700
potential of this as a site for
performing identity, and

00:33:58.700 --> 00:34:02.000
ultimately argued that being
autonomy is not a post racial

00:34:02.000 --> 00:34:05.120
category, but one built from a
very specific and situated

00:34:05.120 --> 00:34:10.040
cultural history. And so in
terms of future work, I'll be

00:34:10.070 --> 00:34:13.970
